@startuml autonomous-capability
title Autonomous Capability , ES:CONCEPT:autonomous-capability
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classFontSize 14
skinparam classBackgroundColor #FAFAFA

class "Capability\n<<universal, foundational>>" as cap
class "Autonomous Capability\n<<contextual specialization>>\nv1.2.0" as acap

cap <|-- acap : specializes

note right of cap
  Universal ; enduring ability
  per ADR-ES-002
end note

note right of acap
  Contextual specialization
  per ADR-ES-013
  Bounded by Authority,
  Policy, Constraints,
  Governance, Escalation
end note

note bottom of acap
  Orthogonal to Agentic Capability
  per ADR-ES-013 §7 + ADR-ES-012 §14
end note
@enduml
